OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells, with a few fog patches
OL,7,Fforming by dawn, particularly across
OL,8,Fparts of Somerset. Temperature
OL,9,Fdropping to low single digits in some
OL,10,Frural spots in the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA bright start to Saturday
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells from the outset.
OL,14,FBecoming breezy through the morning,
OL,15,Fthen cloudier from the north during
OL,16,Fthe afternoon but remaining largely
OL,17,Fdry. Feeling humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
