OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA damp
OL,6,Fstart to Sunday with rain and drizzle,
OL,7,Fbefore another area of rain arrives
OL,8,Ffrom the west for Monday. Fresher on
OL,9,FTuesday with sunny spells and a breeze.
